#: docs/silkie/games.rst:2
msgid "Games for Silkie and kitty"
msgstr "Silkie 与 kitty 游戏"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:10
msgid ""
"Play all five games in the website's Linux terminal, or run them in native Silkie and kitty "
"terminals. Each browser link opens a terminal filling its own window and starts the game "
"automatically. Use **Fullscreen** to hide the browser controls. Each game keeps its own files and"
" saves in this browser's local storage; reopening its link returns to the running window."
msgstr ""
"在网站的 Linux 终端中试玩全部五款游戏，或在原生 Silkie 和 kitty 终端中运行。每个浏览器链接都会在独立窗口中打开终端，并自动启动游戏。使用 **全屏** "
"隐藏浏览器控件。各游戏的文件和存档分别保存在浏览器本地存储中；再次打开链接会返回已有窗口。"

