#: docs/silkie/games.rst:26
msgid "Presidential"
msgstr "Presidential"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:28
msgid ""
"You are President of the United States. Read the daily briefing, draft orders, and press GO to "
"advance a day in a simulation of the world economy. Explore trade, finance, government, "
"diplomacy, and the effects of your policies. Use F1–F9 to switch panels, B for the briefing, and "
"? for help. Campaigns save after each day and when you quit."
msgstr ""
"你是美国总统。在全球经济模拟中阅读每日简报、起草命令，再按 GO 推进一天。探索贸易、金融、政府、外交以及政策的影响。用 F1–F9 切换面板，B 查看简报，? "
"查看帮助。竞选进度会在每天结束后和退出时保存。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:34
msgid ""
"Build from the ``presidential`` checkout with ``cargo install --path crates/terminal-ui``, then "
"run ``presidential``. The economic data and world map are embedded, so the game works offline. "
"See the `Presidential source <https://github.com/adamdeprince/presidential>`_."
msgstr ""
"在 ``presidential`` 检出目录中运行 ``cargo install --path crates/terminal-ui`` 构建，再运行 "
"``presidential``。经济数据和世界地图已内嵌，游戏可离线运行。参阅 `Presidential 源码 "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/presidential>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:39
msgid "Silkie Loophole"
msgstr "Silkie Loophole"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:41
msgid ""
"A raccoon in a bedsheet goes trick-or-treating around Montpelier, Vermont. Collect candy, "
"discover the neighbours' routines, and keep the disguise together. Walk with arrows or WASD, "
"press Space or Enter to interact, M for the map, J for the journal, and ? for help. Ctrl+C quits."
msgstr ""
"一只披着床单的浣熊，在佛蒙特州蒙彼利埃四处讨糖。收集糖果、发现邻居们的作息，并努力维持伪装。方向键或 WASD 行走，空格或 Enter 交互，M 打开地图，J 查看日记，? "
"查看帮助，Ctrl+C 退出。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:46
msgid ""
"Install it from the repositories described under Install Sprint and Scramble below: ``brew "
"install goblinreactor/tap/silkie-loophole`` on Apple Silicon with macOS 26 Tahoe, or ``sudo apt-"
"get install silkie-loophole`` on Ubuntu 26.04 amd64 or Kylin V10 SP1 old-world LoongArch64. Then "
"run ``silkie-loophole``. See the `Loophole source and manual "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/loophole>`_."
msgstr ""
"按下文“安装 Sprint 和 Scramble”配置软件仓库后安装：运行 macOS 26 Tahoe 的 Apple Silicon 机器使用 ``brew install "
"goblinreactor/tap/silkie-loophole``，Ubuntu 26.04 amd64 或麒麟 V10 SP1 旧世界 LoongArch64 使用 ``sudo apt-get install "
"silkie-loophole``。然后运行 ``silkie-loophole``。参阅 `Loophole 源码与手册 "
"<https://github.com/adamdeprince/loophole>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:51
msgid "Sprint and Scramble"
msgstr "Sprint 与 Scramble"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:53
msgid ""
"Silkie Sprint and Silkie Scramble are arcade games set in the same backyard world, with a Silkie "
"hen at the centre of each adventure. They run inside the terminal and require its graphics "
"protocol. The videos below show the games being played in Silkie."
msgstr ""
"Silkie Sprint 和 Silkie Scramble 是发生在同一后院世界的街机游戏，每段冒险都以一只丝羽乌骨鸡为主角。两款游戏在终端中运行，需要终端支持图形协议。下面的视频展示了在 "
"Silkie 中游玩的实际画面。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:58
msgid ""
"Both games support `kitty <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_ and are optimized for Silkie. The "
"rules, scoring, and difficulty are the same in both terminals; Silkie's extensions improve "
"graphics, input, and timing. See :doc:`install` to get Silkie."
msgstr ""
"两款游戏均支持 `kitty <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/>`_，并为 Silkie 做了优化。在两个终端中，规则、计分和难度相同；Silkie "
"的扩展改善图形、输入和时序。安装 Silkie 的方法见 :doc:`install`。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:64
msgid "Install Sprint and Scramble"
msgstr "安装 Sprint 和 Scramble"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:66
msgid ""
"On Apple Silicon with macOS 26 Tahoe, use the `Homebrew repository "
"<https://brew.goblinreactor.com/>`_::"
msgstr "运行 macOS 26 Tahoe 的 Apple Silicon 机器可使用 `Homebrew 仓库 <https://brew.goblinreactor.com/>`_：::"

