#: docs/silkie/games.rst:79
msgid ""
"Open Silkie or kitty and run ``silkie-sprint`` or ``silkie-scramble``. The games are separate "
"packages from the terminal. Check the repository's package listings for the platforms currently "
"available. Kylin packages use the old-world ``loongarch64`` ABI, which differs from new-world "
"``loong64``."
msgstr ""
"打开 Silkie 或 kitty，运行 ``silkie-sprint`` 或 ``silkie-"
"scramble``。游戏和终端是独立的软件包。当前可用平台请查看仓库的软件包列表。麒麟软件包使用旧世界 ``loongarch64`` ABI，与新世界 ``loong64`` 不同。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:86
msgid "Silkie Sprint"
msgstr "Silkie Sprint"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:88
msgid "*Hop the traffic. Ride the river. Fly when you must.*"
msgstr "*跳过车流，搭乘漂木，必要时展翅飞翔。*"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:90
msgid ""
"Guide a Silkie hen across roads, a railway, and a river to the henhouse. Dodge traffic, ride "
"floating logs, and hop into empty nest boxes to lay eggs. Fill every nest and the eggs hatch. "
"Your hen can fly briefly, but her wings need time on the ground to recover, and the sky has "
"hazards too."
msgstr "引导一只丝羽乌骨鸡穿过道路、铁路和河流，抵达鸡舍。躲开车流，搭乘漂浮的木头，跳入空巢产蛋。填满所有巢位，蛋便会孵化。母鸡能短暂飞行，但翅膀需要在地面恢复，天空中也有危险。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:95
msgid "Use the arrow keys or WASD to hop and Space to fly or land. Press P to pause."
msgstr "方向键或 WASD 跳跃，空格起飞或落地，P 暂停。"

