#: docs/silkie/games.rst:109
msgid "Silkie Scramble"
msgstr "Silkie Scramble"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:111
msgid "*Gather the chicks. Mind the fox. Bring them home.*"
msgstr "*召集小鸡，提防狐狸，带它们回家。*"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:113
msgid ""
"Explore a garden maze, gather wandering chicks, and lead them back to the coop. A fox, a weasel, "
"and a hawk threaten your brood. Bringing more chicks home together earns more points, but a "
"longer procession is harder to keep safe. Draw temporary fences to divert predators and use "
"garden gates to control their routes."
msgstr "探索花园迷宫，召集四处游荡的小鸡，带它们返回鸡舍。狐狸、黄鼠狼和鹰威胁着鸡群。一次带回更多小鸡能获得更高分数，但队伍越长，保护起来也越困难。绘制临时围栏引开捕食者，并利用花园门控制它们的路线。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:119
msgid ""
"Use the arrow keys or WASD to move. Draw fences with the mouse, or with a pen or touchscreen in "
"Silkie. Space places a hurdle or operates a nearby latched gate. Press P to pause."
msgstr "方向键或 WASD 移动。用鼠标绘制围栏；在 Silkie 中也可使用笔或触摸屏。空格放置障碍，或操作附近已上闩的门。P 暂停。"

