#: docs/silkie/games.rst:135
msgid "What Silkie adds"
msgstr "Silkie 带来的增强"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:137
msgid ""
"Both games discover terminal capabilities at startup and use kitty's `graphics protocol "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol/>`_ for sprites. Silkie's additional protocols"
" provide:"
msgstr ""
"两款游戏都会在启动时探测终端能力，并使用 kitty 的 `图形协议 <https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol/>`_ "
"显示精灵。Silkie 的扩展协议提供："

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:141
msgid ""
":doc:`Retained vector scenery <vector-protocol>`, with small scene patches for changes such as "
"nest contents, gates, and fences."
msgstr ":doc:`保留式矢量场景 <vector-protocol>`，通过小型场景补丁更新巢位内容、门和围栏等变化。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:143
msgid ""
":doc:`Frame presentation feedback <frame-protocol>` and :doc:`low-latency mode <latency-"
"protocol>` while playing."
msgstr "游玩时使用 :doc:`画面呈现反馈 <frame-protocol>` 与 :doc:`低延迟模式 <latency-protocol>`。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:145
msgid ""
":doc:`Wide-gamut colour <wide-gamut-protocol>` and :doc:`HDR highlights <hdr-protocol>` on "
"supported displays, plus :doc:`translucent menus <cell-alpha-protocol>`."
msgstr ""
"在支持的显示器上使用 :doc:`广色域 <wide-gamut-protocol>` 和 :doc:`HDR 高光 <hdr-protocol>`，以及 :doc:`半透明菜单 <cell-"
"alpha-protocol>`。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:148
msgid ""
":doc:`Pen and touchscreen input <tablet-protocol>`, :doc:`haptic feedback <haptic-protocol>`, and"
" :doc:`custom pointer images <pointer-image-protocol>` where supported."
msgstr ""
"在支持的平台上使用 :doc:`笔与触摸屏输入 <tablet-protocol>`、:doc:`触觉反馈 <haptic-protocol>` 和 :doc:`自定义指针图像 "
"<pointer-image-protocol>`。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:151
msgid ":doc:`Terminal-side ink <ink-protocol>` for pen-drawn fences in Scramble."
msgstr "Scramble 中通过 :doc:`终端侧墨迹 <ink-protocol>` 用笔绘制围栏。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:153
msgid ""
"Run either game with ``--kitty-only`` to compare its baseline presentation with Silkie's "
"enhancements, or ``--report`` to inspect detected capabilities. Run directly in the terminal; the"
" games do not configure graphics passthrough for tmux or screen."
msgstr ""
"运行游戏时加上 ``--kitty-only``，可比较基础画面与 Silkie 增强效果；加上 ``--report`` 可查看探测到的能力。请直接在终端中运行；游戏不会为 tmux 或 "
"screen 配置图形透传。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:52
msgid "Ground Stop"
msgstr "Ground Stop"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:55
msgid "*The last airport in America is in Montpelier, Vermont.*"
msgstr "*美国最后一座机场在佛蒙特州蒙彼利埃。*"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:57
msgid ""
"A software update has grounded every airport in America except Montpelier Municipal, which still "
"runs on floppy disks, and every aircraft in the region is coming there. Bring them down in an "
"endless air traffic control game on a sweeping radar. Every aircraft flies a real flight model, "
"with drag, engines, fuel, ice, and wind."
msgstr "一次软件更新让美国所有机场停摆，只有仍在使用软盘的蒙彼利埃市立机场幸免，这一地区的所有飞机都在朝它飞来。在扫描雷达上引导它们降落，这是一款没有尽头的空中交通管制游戏。每架飞机都有真实的飞行模型，包括阻力、发动机、燃油、结冰和风。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:63
msgid ""
"Click an aircraft to select it. W and S set its speed, A and D its heading, and Z and X its "
"altitude. Press Enter to take the landing it offers, or click a runway, road, or field to send it"
" there. Tab selects the next aircraft, Space pauses, and ? shows help. Press Q twice to quit."
msgstr ""
"点击飞机将其选中。W 和 S 设定速度，A 和 D 设定航向，Z 和 X 设定高度。按 Enter 接受它提供的着陆方案，或点击跑道、道路或田野，让它在那里降落。Tab "
"选择下一架飞机，空格键暂停，? 显示帮助。连按两次 Q 退出。"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:68
msgid ""
"<figure class=\"gameplay\">\n"
"  <img src=\"_static/games/ground-stop.png\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\" alt=\"The Ground Stop"
" radar over Montpelier, with aircraft, their data blocks, predicted paths, and the places they "
"can land\">\n"
"  <figcaption>Ground Stop in Silkie, drawing its radar with retained vector "
"graphics.</figcaption>\n"
"</figure>"
msgstr ""
"<figure class=\"gameplay\">\n"
"  <img src=\"../_static/games/ground-stop.png\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1000\" alt=\"蒙彼利埃上空的 "
"Ground Stop 雷达，显示飞机、数据块、预测航迹以及可以降落的地点\">\n"
"  <figcaption>Ground Stop 在 Silkie 中运行，用保留式矢量图形绘制雷达。</figcaption>\n"
"</figure>"

#: docs/silkie/games.rst:75
msgid ""
"Build from the ``ground-stop`` checkout with ``cargo install --path .``, then run ``ground-"
"stop``. Silkie draws the radar as retained vectors; plain kitty receives the same radar as "
"pixels. See the `Ground Stop source and manual <https://github.com/adamdeprince/ground-stop>`_."
msgstr ""
"在 ``ground-stop`` 检出目录中运行 ``cargo install --path .`` 构建，再运行 ``ground-stop``。Silkie "
"以保留式矢量图形绘制雷达；普通 kitty 则以像素接收同样的雷达画面。参阅 `Ground Stop 源码与手册 <https://github.com/adamdeprince"
"/ground-stop>`_。"
